h('SafeRouter ReplayLab');p('Hack Apertus 2026 | Track 2B | Sumplus - Jakob');p(intro);h('1 / A bounded, inspectable pipeline');p('Requested path -> local Apertus proposal -> schema and resource validation -> separate reference/target execution -> minimized divergence -> independent replay bundle. The model does not decide correctness or execute code.');p('On-premise is the tested target architecture. Deterministic replay works with Docker network disabled. Live local inference requires separately provisioned model assets. A fully air-gapped live deployment and Swiss cloud are not claimed.');p('The application exposes actual recorded responses, original timings, target traces and downloadable replay packages. Manual edits are labelled manual; model failure is explicit. A negative result is limited to the current sequence.');h('Protocol v1');p((R/'data/protocol.md').read_text().split('\n',1)[1]);p('Protocol and synthetic defects were frozen before model inference. The detailed reference was authored with coding-assistant help; independent human validation has not been recorded.');page()
h('2 / Model, data and an observed repair');p('Apertus 1.5 8B Q4_K_M, llama.cpp b11429 d81235049, local CPU two threads, GPU disabled, context 4096, one slot, temperature 0 seed 42. No fine-tuning. The externally supplied GGUF digest fixes the tested artifact; exact quantization origin is not independently certified.');p('The native adapter uses apply-template, completion(return_tokens=true), and detokenize. One ordered32/33 thinking boundary is required; only the final answer tail is parsed. All candidates face independent field/type/operation/resource validation.');p('Model input includes the DSL, one non-streaming request/cancel example and the requested path. Target labels/source, gold paths, observations and decisions are never provided.');p('Twelve newly authored tasks include ten executable paths, two rejection cases, and German text. All data is synthetic. Six complete injected fault families and two clean labels were frozen before output; original commit976c383.');p('Initial adapter: disabled thinking produced no required boundaries, so all 12 answers were rejected. A null-comparison scoring bug is explicitly corrected by a separate rescore, retaining original raw rows. The repaired adapter enables thinking and clarifies op values with one teaching example. Same-task repetitions are disclosed, not treated as untouched heldout tests.');p(f'Repaired set: {summary["valid"]}/12 executable candidates; {summary["exact"]}/12 exact task outcomes including expected rejections. Repaired inference {summary["model_generation_seconds"]:.2f}s; failed initial cohort plus diagnostic {summary["repair_generation_seconds"]:.2f}s; model startup {summary["startup_seconds"]:.2f}s. All {summary["total_model_attempts"]} attempts count in comparison-pipeline cost {cost:.2f}s.');p('Weights were pre-existing, so download is excluded. Specification authoring and preparation were not timed. No provider fees, production-provider API usage, customer data or productivity claim.');page()
h('3 / Complete bounded comparison');p('A: Hypothesis 6.151.9 stateful generation. B: the same generator after model seeds. Both arms share DSL, reference, targets, oracle and deletion shrinker. Native Hypothesis failure shrinking is disabled for shared accounting. This is a real but bounded stateful configuration, not exhaustive tool tuning.');p('Five fixed generator seeds 17,29,43,71,101; 12 steps per example; 800 target operations or 10 seconds per target/seed/arm. All candidate/shrinking operations count. Full startup and failed/repaired generation costs are divided equally across all eight targets in each replicate. The same model set is reused across generator seeds. The time view applies cutoffs to measured generation latency, not five new model deadline launches.');
data=[['Budget','Arm','Fault trials found','Clean false positives']]+[[g['mode'],g['arm'],f"{g['defect_hits']}/{g['defect_trials']}",str(g['false_positives'])] for g in groups]
